readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	reportbugs1	reportbugs1			0	zh-CN	The ${PRODUCTNAME} Web site hosts <a href="https://bz.apache.org/ooo/">BugZilla</a>, our mechanism for reporting, tracking and solving bugs and issues. We encourage all users to feel entitled and welcome to report issues that may arise on your particular platform. Energetic reporting of issues is one of the most important contributions that the user community can make to the ongoing development and improvement of the suite.				20200411 15:09:53
