helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	zh-CN	Java 平台支持				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	zh-CN	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Java 平台支持\"\>Java 平台支持\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	zh-CN	$[officename] 支持 Java 平台以运行基于 JavaBeans 体系结构的应用程序和组件。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	zh-CN	要使 $[officename] 支持 Java 平台，必须先安装 Java 2 Runtime Environment 软件。如果还没有安装该软件，在安装 $[officename] 时，系统会自动提示您安装相应的文件。如果需要，可以就在此时安装这些文件。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	zh-CN	在 $[officename] 中，执行 Java 应用程序之前需要先启动 Java 平台支持。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	zh-CN	请选择\<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - 首选项\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>工具 - 选项\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\> 激活 Java 平台支持。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	zh-CN	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	zh-CN	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
