helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	zh-CN	弧度 = (度 * Pi)/180				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	zh-CN	Pi 的近似值是 3.141593。				20200411 15:09:53
