helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	zh-CN	\<image id=\"img_id3147834\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_paraspacedecrease.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147834\"\>图标\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145211				0	zh-CN	缩小间隔				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	zh-CN	您可以通过选择\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\" name=\"格式 - 段落 - 缩进和间距\"\>\<emph\>格式 - 段落 - 缩进和间距\</emph\>\</link\>对间距进行进一步的调整。				20200411 15:09:53
