helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154596	27			0	zh-CN	可见列表条目 ("ListBox1=Item")。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146892				0	zh-CN	<OPTION VALUE="Value">Item				20200411 15:09:53
