helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155341				0	zh-CN	\<image id=\"img_id3150943\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_config.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150943\"\>图标\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
