helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011855				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>模板图标可以打开“模板和文档”对话框。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105045				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>模板\</emph\>图标打开\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/aaa_start.xhp\"\>模板和文挡\</link\>对话框。				20200411 15:09:53
