helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114	11			0	zh-CN	在\<emph\>表单导航\</emph\>工具栏上，单击\<link href=\"text/shared/02/12120000.xhp\" name=\"Apply Filter\"\>\<emph\>应用筛选\</emph\>\</link\>图标\<image id=\"img_id3144764\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_datafilterstandardfilter.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3144764\"\>图标\</alt\>\</image\>以修改为筛选视图。				20200411 15:09:53
