helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	zh-CN	利用图标\<emph\>添加到书签\</emph\>，您可以在当前显示的帮助页面上设置一个书签。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	zh-CN	您可以在选项卡\<emph\>书签\</emph\>中找到书签。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>双击一个书签或者按回车键来打开帮助中对应的页面。单击右键打开上下文菜单。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	zh-CN	用 Del 键删除选定书签。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	zh-CN	书签的上下文菜单中有以下命令：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>显示\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>显示选定的帮助主题\</ahelp\>。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>重命名\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>打开一个对话框，输入书签的另一个名称\</ahelp\>。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>删除\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>删除选定书签。\</ahelp\>。				20200411 15:09:53
