helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>从当前的自定义词典中删除标记的单词。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
