helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148577				0	zh-CN	反向				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150486				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"sw:CheckBox:TP_OPTPRINT_PAGE:CB_REVERSE\"\>指定是否逆序打印。将从文档的最后一页开始打印。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
