helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147216				0	zh-CN	在段落之前				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146148				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_STD_PARAGRAPH:ED_TOPDIST\"\>输入选定段落上方要留出的间距值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
