helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147376				0	zh-CN	{2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	zh-CN	定义左括号前面的字符的出现次数。例如，"tre{2}" 将找到并选中 "tree"。				20200411 15:09:53
