helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	zh-CN	{1,}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id843836				0	zh-CN	定义左括号前面的字符出现的最小次数。例如，"tre{2,}" 可以找到 "tree"、"treee" 以及 "treeeee"。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	zh-CN	( )				20200411 15:09:53
