helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05200100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	zh-CN	\<variable id=\"breitetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_LINE:MTR_FLD_LINE_WIDTH\"\>选择线条的宽度。您可以附加度量单位。线条宽度为零时将在输出媒体上产生一条宽度为一个像素的极细的线条。\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05200100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	zh-CN	透明				20200411 15:09:53
