helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154936				0	zh-CN	左右内容相同				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938	22			0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_HEADER:CB_SHARED\"\>奇数页和偶数页共享相同的内容。\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>要为奇数页和偶数页指定不同的页眉，请取消此选项，并单击\<emph\>编辑\</emph\>。\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
