helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803553767				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The document being exported will be embedded inside the PDF file.\</ahelp\> Some PDF tools or %PRODUCTNAME extensions may allow to extract the file from the PDF and save it; in this way, the original %PRODUCTNAME document can be edited back without the need of a PDF editing application.				20200411 15:09:53
