helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>防止未经授权的用户访问此数据库。每个会话只需输入一次密码。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
