helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6571550				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>选择两个或更多个对象并且单击此图标将对象大小调整到最大宽度。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
