helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN100BC				0	zh-CN	\<image id=\"img_id3147507\" src=\"starmath/res/fu21506.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147507\"\>图标\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
