helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145366				0	zh-CN	无				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:BTN_NONE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>不计算分类汇总。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
