helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150337				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>Number1; Number2;...Number30\</emph\> 是数值或区域。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153571				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	zh-CN	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MODE(A1:A50)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
