helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id9210486				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>打开“求解器”对话框。求解器通过单变量求解方法使用多个未知变量来求解方程式。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id8538773				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>输入或单击目标单元格的单元格引用。该字段接受其值将要被优化的单元格地址。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id7564012				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>试着求解目标单元格最大值方程式。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id1186254				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>试着求解目标单元格最小值方程式。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
