helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3145632	36			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=AND(12<13;14>12;7<6)\</item\> 返回 FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
