helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149890				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FALSCH\"\>返回逻辑值 FALSE。\</ahelp\>函数 FALSE() 不需要任何参数，并始终返回逻辑值 FALSE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146939				0	zh-CN	语法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150030				0	zh-CN	FALSE()				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150697				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154842	8			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FALSE()\</item\> 返回 FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3147468	9			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NOT(FALSE())\</item\> 返回 TRUE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150141				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>IF 函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150141				0	zh-CN	IF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148740				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WENN\"\>指定要执行的逻辑测试。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153325				0	zh-CN	语法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558				0	zh-CN	IF(Test; ThenValue; OtherwiseValue)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149727	52			0	zh-CN	            \<emph\>Test\</emph\> 是 TRUE 或 FALSE 的任意值或表达式。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155828	53			0	zh-CN	            \<emph\>ThenValue\</emph\> （可选择的）是逻辑测试结果为 TRUE 时返回的值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811	54			0	zh-CN	            \<emph\>OtherwiseValue\</emph\>（可选择的）是逻辑测试结果为 FALSE 时返回的值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	zh-CN	            \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>         				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149507				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150867	57			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=IF(A1>5;100;"太小")\</item\> 如果单元格 A1 的值大于 5，则在当前单元格中输入值 100；否则以文本格式输入“太小”（无引号）。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155954				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>NOT 函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155954				0	zh-CN	NOT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153570				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NICHT\"\>补余（反转）一个逻辑值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147372				0	zh-CN	语法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3157996				0	zh-CN	NOT(LogicalValue)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148766	16			0	zh-CN	            \<emph\>LogicalValue\</emph\> 是要补余的数值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149884				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150132	18			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NOT(A)\</item\>。如果 A=TRUE，则 NOT(A) 为 FALSE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>OR 函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394				0	zh-CN	OR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>至少有一个参数为 TRUE 时，函数返回 TRUE。\</ahelp\>如果所有参数的逻辑值都为 FALSE，该函数返回 FALSE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	zh-CN	参数应该是能返回逻辑值的逻辑表达式 (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10)，或包含逻辑值的矩阵 (A1:C3)。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546				0	zh-CN	如果函数需要单个参数，但输入的是单元格区域，则从单元格区域中选择与公式相同行或列中的值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	zh-CN	如果输入的区域超出了公式当前列或行之外，函数将返回错误值 #VALUE!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517				0	zh-CN	语法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	zh-CN	OR(LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	zh-CN	            \<emph\>LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30\</emph\> 是要检查的条件。所有条件可以是 TRUE 或 FALSE。如果输入一个区域作为参数，函数将使用处于当前列或行的区域的值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228				0	zh-CN	示例：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154870				0	zh-CN	检查 12<11; 13>22 以及 45=45 的逻辑值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371	27			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(12<11;13>22;45=45)\</item\> 返回 TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412	59			0	zh-CN	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> 返回 TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394K				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>XOR 函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394K				0	zh-CN	XOR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060K				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Returns the exclusive "or" of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771K				0	zh-CN	The arguments are either numbers, logical expressions themselves (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10) that return logical values, or arrays (A1:C3).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027K				0	zh-CN	如果输入的区域超出了公式当前行或列范围，函数将返回错误值 #VALUE!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517K				0	zh-CN	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468K				0	zh-CN	XOR(值1; 值2 ...值30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819K				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>Value1; Value2 ...Value30\</emph\> are added modulo 2. TRUE is returned if the result of this addition is 1;FALSE is returned if the result of this addition is 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228K				0	zh-CN	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371K				0	zh-CN	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(12<11;13>22;10)\</item\> returns TRUE since this converts to (1+0+10) mod 2 = 0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412K				0	zh-CN	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> returns TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	zh-CN	数学函数				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147124				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>数学函数\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>函数向导; 数学\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>函数; 数学函数\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>三角函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147124				0	zh-CN	数学函数				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154943				0	zh-CN	\<variable id=\"mathematiktext\"\>此类别包含 Calc 的\<emph\>数学\</emph\>函数。\</variable\>要打开\<emph\>函数向导\</emph\>，请选择\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"插入 - 函数\"\>\<emph\>插入 - 函数\</emph\>\</link\>。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146944				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>ABS 函数\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>绝对值\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>值; 绝对\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
