helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	zh-CN	NOMINAL(EffectiveRate; NPerY)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147521				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>EffectiveRate\</emph\> 有效利率				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156334				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>NPerY\</emph\> 每年支付利息的周期数。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154473				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147091				0	zh-CN	假设实际利率为13.5%，且每年支付利息的次数为12次。要计算的是年名义利率。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	zh-CN	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL(13.5%;12)\</item\> = 12.73%。即年名义利率为 12.73%。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155123				0	zh-CN	\<bookmark_value\>NOMINAL_ADD 函数\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155123				0	zh-CN	NOMINAL_ADD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148671				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_NOMINAL\"\>根据实际利率和年付息次数计算名义年利率。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155611				0	zh-CN	语法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156157				0	zh-CN	NOMINAL_ADD(EffectiveRate; NPerY)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153777				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>EffectiveRate\</emph\> 实际年利率。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150409				0	zh-CN	\<emph\>NPerY\</emph\> 指的是每年支付利息的次数。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146789				0	zh-CN	示例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	zh-CN	实际利率为 5.354% 且每季度付息时，名义利率是多少呢？				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	zh-CN	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL_ADD(5.3543%;4)\</item\> 返回 0.0525 或 5.25%。				20200411 15:09:53
