helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	zh-CN	在\<emph\>新区域\</emph\>框中键入名称，然后选中\<emph\>链接\</emph\>复选框。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	zh-CN	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\> box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	zh-CN	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619				0	zh-CN	如果需要，您可以设置区域的格式选项。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149862				0	zh-CN	单击\<emph\>插入\</emph\>。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	zh-CN	每当源文档发生改变时，$[officename] 都会自动更新所插入区域的内容。要手动更新区域的内容，请选择\<emph\>工具 - 更新 - 全部更新\</emph\>。				20200411 15:09:53
