helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154959				0	zh-CN	重命名				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379	68			0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_BIB_BASE:PB_RENAME\"\>将选定的自动图文集类别的名称修改为您在\<emph\>名称\</emph\>框中输入的名称。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154120				0	zh-CN	选择列表				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154137				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLOS_GROUP_TREE\"\>列出现有的自动图文集类别以及对应的路径。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
