helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155184				0	zh-CN	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:DLB_LINEPOS\"\>选择正文与脚注区域之间分隔线的水平对齐方式。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
